     "content": "You are comparing two drafts written from the same brief. Read no other file, and do not run commands or browse; judge only the text below.\n\nBrief: Write the landing page copy for `sackview`, following the tool page section order.\n\n<<<DRAFT A\n# See inside a ZIP archive\n\nsackview shows what is inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. Use its total unpacked size to check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\nInstall sackview:\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\nEach entry shows its name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\nList the entries in an archive:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\n## Commands\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Good to know\n\n| Topic | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Archive safety | sackview never extracts entries or changes the archive. |\n| Privacy | Inspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service. |\n| Supported formats | sackview supports ZIP archives only. Other formats produce an unsupported-format message and return exit code 24. |\nDRAFT A>>>\n\n<<<DRAFT B\n# sackview\n\nSee what\u2019s inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it.\n\nView each entry\u2019s name, compressed size, and unpacked size. Check the total unpacked size against your available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the entries in a ZIP archive:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Inspect offline\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive. Inspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n## Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.\nDRAFT B>>>\n\nAnswer each question with \"A\", \"B\", or \"SAME\":\n- \"reader\": Could a first-time reader do what they came to do?\n- \"careful\": Does it read like a careful person wrote it?\n- \"overall\": Which draft is better overall?\n\nReply with only JSON: {\"reader\": \"A\", \"careful\": \"A\", \"overall\": \"A\", \"reason\": \"<one sentence>\"}",
